<main id="main-content" class="faq-section">
    <h1 style="text-align: center; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 30px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>What are your environmental and conservation commitments?</h2>
        <p>We are a dedicated protection facility. We finance rescue operations for shorebirds, run coral restoration testbeds, and lead marine-pollution educational courses.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>What are your operating schedules?</h2>
        <p>We are accessible to the public every day of the week from <strong>9:00 AM up to 6:00 PM</strong>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
        <h2>Is flash photography permitted?</h2>
        <p>No. Rapidly flashing bursts induce severe shock configurations in fish and invertebrates. Flash systems must be kept disabled.</p>
    </div>
</main>
